// EMULATION_EDGE's fitting scenario (todo #100 Task 7) — and the file that
// carries the risk the design spec named: "a strong species could replace
// the player's build". A geared level-20 player, alone (no party, so
// nothing but the player's own kit is doing the fighting), against thirteen
// rootkits at zone 3 — past `zone_group_cap`'s ceiling of 4, deliberately,
// because on-curve the player's own kit already wins this at 100%. The
// count was refit at F10 (final review, 2026-09-18): the six-rootkit pack
// this used to be was already a walkover (100% win, both with and without
// an image) once `character:` below spends real Perk Points — a perked,
// geared level-20 player is simply stronger than the ungeared, unperked one
// the original count was fit against. Thirteen is a coinflip for this
// build's own kit (39.0%), which is what makes a kit swap's effect visible
// at all.
//
// `emulate: Some("zero_day")` is the strongest species an image can ever
// actually be learned for — U1 (final review, 2026-09-18) refuses an apex
// species' (`is_boss: true`) image at the extraction door, so `wintermute`
// is unreachable in play and this scenario no longer stages it.
// `growth_multiplier: 1.5` and `base_atk: 16` are both the ceiling among
// ordinary species. Delete the `emulate:` row for the control (the
// player's own geared kit, no image). Swap the species to compare another
// image; `docs/measurements/2026-09-18-emulation-edge.md` has the sweep
// across the roster.
//
// `character:` spends Perk Points the way a level-20 player actually would
// — F10 (final review, 2026-09-18): every point of the level's 40-point
// allowance, split Attacker/Defender/Buffer/Low Power Mode, so
// `components::BoughtStats` (F5, U2) shows up in this measurement rather
// than being silently zero. `class: Striker` is along for realism alone —
// `arena::scenario::CharacterSpec`'s own doc: a class is an affinity spread
// over *authored routine power*, and `PartyPlan::AllAttack` invokes no
// routine, so it changes nothing this bin reports.
(
    player: Fresh(level: 20, zone: 3),
    character: (
        class: Some(Striker),
        perk_points: 40,
        perks: [(Attacker, 5), (Defender, 5), (Buffer, 4), (LowPowerMode, 4)],
    ),
    equip: [
        (item: "plasma_router", tier: 0),
        (item: "bastion_lattice", tier: 0),
        (item: "singularity_matrix", tier: 0),
    ],
    emulate: Some("zero_day"),
    opponents: [(species: "rootkit", count: 13)],
    reps: 200,
    seed: 7,
)
